## Run it

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm claim:verify   # re-derives all claims in CLAIM_LEDGER.md and WHAT_IS_REAL.md
make test           # runs the test suite
make dev            # starts the app locally
make deploy         # deploys to Cloudflare Pages / Vercel
```

